  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **WORLD EATERS** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), as each [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, you can roll 8D6 as your Blessings of Khorne roll, then spend the dice on activating as many as 2 of the Blessings of Khorne below. Each Blessing lists the dice it needs; where it names a number, it needs a double or a triple of at least that number. Each Blessing can be activated only once per battle round, and any dice left unspent are discarded. Each activated Blessing applies to all your units with this ability for the rest of the battle round. The Blessings are:\n\n- **Unbridled Bloodlust** (any double): the unit gets +1 to its [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).\n- **Rage-Fuelled Invigoration** (double 2+): the unit's models can go up to 6\" rather than 3\" when making a [Pile-in move](vsdata:core-rule/pile-in-move) or [Consolidation move](vsdata:core-rule/consolidation-move).\n- **Total Carnage** (double 3+): whenever a melee attack **destroys** a model of the unit, if that model has not fought in the phase, roll a D6. On a 4+, leave it on the battlefield: once the attacking unit finishes its attacks, the model can fight, then it is removed.\n- **Martial Excellence** (double 4+ or any triple): the melee weapons of the unit's models get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Warp Blades** (double 5+ or triple 2+): the melee weapons of the unit's models get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Decapitating Strikes** (double 6 or triple 3+): the melee attacks of the unit's models against **INFANTRY** units get **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**.",
